ots 1
# journey-destruct: type DESTRUCT at the title; one CPU-vs-CPU round of 5 Card War;
# leave to the title.
# Authored against ot-ref-run (virtual clock); the title menu is ready at ~8.1 s.
# title: type DESTRUCT
@8500 key-down D
@8560 key-up D
@8700 key-down E
@8760 key-up E
@8900 key-down S
@8960 key-up S
@9100 key-down T
@9160 key-up T
@9300 key-down R
@9360 key-up R
@9500 key-down U
@9560 key-up U
@9700 key-down C
@9760 key-up C
@9900 key-down T
@9960 key-up T
# intro: any key
@12100 key-down SPACE
@12160 key-up SPACE
# mode select: 5 Card War
@14300 key-down RETURN
@14360 key-up RETURN
# F11: the right player becomes a CPU too (the left one is a CPU by default)
@16500 key-down F11
@16560 key-up F11
# CPU vs CPU: the first round ends near 110 s (a new map is drawn at ~111.8 s)
# Escape: back to mode select; Escape: leave Destruct (title at ~116.4 s)
@113000 key-down ESCAPE
@113060 key-up ESCAPE
@115700 key-down ESCAPE
@115760 key-up ESCAPE
